      <ul><li><a href="https://sports.ndtv.com/athletics/india-in-athletics-asian-games-2026-live-updates-gulveer-singh-avinash-sable-12112283#publisher=newsstand" rel="noopener">NDTV Sports</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
