     <article class="story single" data-beat="cricket">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">CRICKET</span> · Crictracker · 2026-09-29 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>IND vs WI 2026: Kuldeep Yadav eyes 200-wicket landmark in Guwahati ODI</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#cricket</span> <span>#India</span> <span>#West Indies</span> <span>#Kuldeep Yadav</span></div>
       <p>The cricketing world turns its attention to Guwahati, where India's prolific left-arm wrist-spinner, Kuldeep Yadav, stands on the precipice of a significant career milestone. As the 2nd ODI against West Indies approaches on September 30, all eyes will be on Yadav, who requires just two more wickets to join an elite club of Indian spinners.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-29/ind-vs-wi-2026-kuldeep-yadav-eyes-200-wicket-landmark-in-guw.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Should he achieve this feat, Yadav will become only the fourth Indian spinner in history to claim 200 One Day International scalps. This landmark achievement would further solidify his reputation as a formidable force in white-ball cricket, showcasing his consistent ability to bamboozle batsmen with his unique variations. The upcoming match in Guwahati, therefore, holds considerable significance, not just for the series but also for Yadav's individual legacy.</p><p>The anticipation is palpable as fans and pundits alike await what promises to be a memorable moment in Indian cricket. Yadav's journey to this point has been marked by crucial performances and match-winning spells, making his potential 200th wicket all the more special. His impact on the team's success has been undeniable, and reaching this milestone would be a testament to his dedication and skill.</p><p>The 2nd ODI on September 30 in Guwahati is set to be a captivating encounter, with the added subplot of Kuldeep Yadav's pursuit of history.</p><p>What to watch: Kuldeep Yadav's quest for his 200th ODI wicket against West Indies.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately reflects the source information regarding Kuldeep Yadav's milestone and the upcoming match details.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/ind-vs-wi-2026-kuldeep-yadav-eyes-200-wicket-landmark-in-guwahati-odi/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/guwahati/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Guwahati</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
