       <h1>Ken Jeong, Daniel Dae Kim, Randall Park Starring in &amp;#8216;The Moons of LA&amp;#8217; Coming-of-Age Comedy Series at Audible</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Entertainment</span> <span>#Audible</span> <span>#Comedy Series</span> <span>#Ken Jeong</span></div>
       <p>A new star-studded comedy series, &quot;The Moons of LA,&quot; is set to premiere exclusively on Audible, featuring a prominent cast including Ken Jeong, Randall Park, and Daniel Dae Kim. The series promises a unique narrative with a meta twist, aiming to captivate listeners with its innovative storytelling.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-29/ken-jeong-daniel-dae-kim-randall-park-starring-in-8216the-mo.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>&quot;The Moons of LA&quot; is described as a coming-of-age comedy that centers on a child protagonist. This character, notably obsessed with true-crime podcasts, utilizes her acquired investigative skills in a rather personal mission: to help save her parents' marriage. This premise suggests a blend of humor, youthful perspective, and a clever application of contemporary cultural phenomena like podcast fandom.</p><p>The involvement of acclaimed actors such as Ken Jeong, Randall Park, and Daniel Dae Kim is expected to bring significant comedic talent and depth to the audio series. Their collective presence underscores the high production value and the anticipated quality of the show. Listeners can mark their calendars for the premiere, as &quot;The Moons of LA&quot; is scheduled to debut on October 8, exclusively available on the Audible platform. This release adds another high-profile project to Audible's growing content library.</p><p>What to watch: The reception of this meta-comedy series and its unique premise on Audible.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article provides an accurate summary of the Variety report.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://variety.com/2026/digital/news/ken-jeong-daniel-dae-kim-randall-park-moons-of-la-audible-1236875755/" rel="noopener">Variety</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
