       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">BUSINESS</span> · Business Standard · 2026-09-29 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>TVS Motor leases 529,533 sq ft office space in Bengaluru for 10 years</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Business</span> <span>#Real Estate</span> <span>#TVS Motor</span> <span>#Bengaluru</span></div>
       <p>TVS Motor Company has secured a substantial office space lease in Bengaluru, acquiring 529,533 square feet for a period of ten years. The significant transaction underscores the company's expansion or consolidation plans within the bustling technology hub.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-29/tvs-motor-leases-529533-sq-ft-office-space-in-bengaluru-for-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The long-term lease agreement is for space located at Gardencity IT Park in Hebbal, a prominent commercial area in Bengaluru. The lease officially commenced on September 22, indicating an immediate or near-term operational requirement for the vast premises. This move signifies a strategic investment in physical infrastructure for TVS Motor.</p><p>Financial details of the deal reveal a considerable commitment, with the monthly rent for the leased area estimated at approximately ₹4.7 crore. Over the ten-year period, this translates into a substantial expenditure, reflecting the premium nature of commercial real estate in Bengaluru and the scale of the space acquired. Real estate advisory firm Colliers played a pivotal role in facilitating the transaction, providing expert guidance throughout the leasing process. This major property deal highlights the ongoing demand for large-scale office spaces by leading corporations in India’s tech capital.</p><p>What to watch: How TVS Motor utilizes this new large office space in Bengaluru.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article correctly incorporates all key data points from the source summary.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.business-standard.com/companies/news/tvs-motor-leases-529-533-sq-ft-office-space-in-bengaluru-for-10-years-126092901013_1.html" rel="noopener">Business Standard</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
