       <h1>Virat Kohli's adaptability hailed as his true greatness by Abhishek Nayar</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Cricket</span> <span>#Virat Kohli</span> <span>#Abhishek Nayar</span> <span>#KKR</span></div>
       <p>Abhishek Nayar, the former India assistant coach and current Kolkata Knight Riders head coach, has offered fresh insight into what defines Virat Kohli’s stellar career. Nayar argues that the star batter’s greatest attribute is not merely his raw talent, but his unique mentality and his ability to fundamentally change his method when required. In a detailed assessment, the KKR coach explains that this adaptability is what truly sets Kohli apart from his contemporaries. Nayar highlights that while many cricketers possess exceptional skill, few possess the mental resilience to adjust their approach in response to varying conditions and pressures. This flexibility, Nayar suggests, is the cornerstone of Kohli’s longevity and success at the highest level. The comments come as the cricketing world continues to analyze the factors behind Kohli’s enduring dominance. By focusing on the psychological and tactical adjustments rather than just the physical execution, Nayar provides a nuanced perspective on the batter’s evolution. The former assistant coach’s remarks underscore the importance of mental fortitude in modern cricket. As teams and opponents continue to study Kohli’s game, his capacity to innovate and shift his strategy remains a critical weapon. Nayar’s analysis serves as a reminder that technical proficiency alone is insufficient; it is the mindset and willingness to evolve that define true greatness in the sport. This viewpoint adds depth to the ongoing discussions surrounding Kohli’s legacy and his impact on the game.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-29/virat-kohlis-adaptability-hailed-as-his-true-greatness-by-ab.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>What to watch: How Kohli’s mental adaptability influences his performance in upcoming high-pressure matches.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Well-written expansion of the source summary regarding Abhishek Nayar's assessment of Virat Kohli.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/virat-kohlis-mentality-and-ability-to-change-his-method-is-his-true-greatness-says-abhishek-nayar/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
