      <ul><li><a href="https://phys.org/news/2026-09-wearable-nanotech-combat-nerve-agents.html" rel="noopener">Phys.org</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
